# Only permanents that entered under the Mice's controller's control count: on turn three Bot1 casts the Mice, and in response Bot2
# flashes in a Brazen Borrower. It entered under Bot2's control, so the Mice stay 3/1 (with the Borrower counted they would be the
# second nonland permanent and the Mice 3/3); Bot1's own Memnite then makes the second one, so 3/3.

